  "description": "Han Jae-hyun, who works as a psychiatrist, unexpectedly runs into his one-night stand from the night before, Seo Bae-in, at the hospital.\n\nBae-in claims to suffer from multiple personality disorder, but Jae-hyun quickly realizes it is all an act—a clever ploy by Bae-in to sleep with him once again...\n\nAccustomed to a promiscuous lifestyle—from casual hookups via dating apps to sleeping with the hospital director for success—Jae-hyun doesn't hesitate for a second to go along with Bae-in's trick.\n\nLittle does he know, he is digging his own grave...\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000081375)",
